    "detailed_description": "Use the rules of the famous Tower of Hanoi puzzle,<br>where a larger piece cannot be on top of a smaller one.<br><br>Every move the piece Spins clockwise changing its pattern,<br>in most of the cases you have to do one or more extra moves to get the right pattern when stacking.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2>  <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 50 carefully designed levels;<br></li><li> Original soundtrack inspired by Synthwave classics and some cyberpunk touches;<br></li><li> Relaxing gameplay, perfect for those looking for casual puzzle;<br></li><li> Beautiful futuristic art.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Use the rules of the famous Tower of Hanoi puzzle,<br>where a larger piece cannot be on top of a smaller one.<br><br>Every move the piece Spins clockwise changing its pattern,<br>in most of the cases you have to do one or more extra moves to get the right pattern when stacking.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2>  <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 50 carefully designed levels;<br></li><li> Original soundtrack inspired by Synthwave classics and some cyberpunk touches;<br></li><li> Relaxing gameplay, perfect for those looking for casual puzzle;<br></li><li> Beautiful futuristic art.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Inspired by the classic Tower of Hanoi, Assemble towers by spinning pieces to get the right pattern on a hexagonal board with a mysterious and relaxing atmosphere.",
